# The cloud repo is authoritative and the byte is the unit of truth:
# catalog snapshots are hash-pinned over their EXACT on-disk bytes, and
# archived real-config fixtures are provenance-hashed the same way.
# Git newline translation (core.autocrlf) silently rewrites those bytes
# at checkout (field incident 2026-08-18: a checked-out LF snapshot came
# back CRLF and tripped the demo integrity gate). Disable conversion for
# every file, in both directions, for every clone.
* -text
